{name="6-11 Elwynn Forest",lo=6,hi=11,next="11-13 Loch Modan",tips={
[1]={"Click the green Kobold Tracks on the ground as you travel toward Goldshire","Use the [Kobold Tracking Kit] to track them on your minimap"},
[6]={"Type \"/sit\" in chat and wait for one minute around the campfire"},
[11]={"Click the green Kobold Tracks on the ground","Use the [Kobold Tracking Kit] to track them on your minimap"},
[12]={"This will allow you to make [Rough Sharpening Stones] which increase your melee damage by 2","This will allow you to make [Rough Weightstones] which increase your melee damage by 2","If you don't want to do this, skip this step"},
[26]={"Skip this step if you don't have 1 silver, or if you wish to do it later"},
[42]={"Talk to Remy \"Two Times\""},
[43]={"Buy and equip a [Hornwood Recurve Bow]","Buy [Rough Arrows] until your Quiver is full"},
[47]={"Cast [Lesser Heal (Rank 2)] and [Power Word: Fortitude] on Guard Roberts"},
[49]={"Kill Stonetusk Boars. Loot them for their [Chunks of Boar Meat]","This will be used to level your [Cooking] later","You need 10 [Cooking] for a quest in Auberdine later"},
[50]={"Kill Stonetusk Boars. Loot them for their [Chunks of Boar Meat]","This will be used to level your [Cooking] later","You need 50 [Cooking] for a quest in Darkshire later.","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the boars you're passing by"},
[51]={"Talk to \"Auntie\" Bernice Stonefield and Ma Stonefield"},
[55]={"Kill Kobold Tunnelers and Kobold Miners. Loot them for their Kobold Candles and Gold Dust"},
[56]={"Kill Kobold Tunnelers and Kobold Miners. Loot them for their Kobold Candles, Gold Dust and Lost Books"},
[63]={"Kill Kobold Tunnelers and Kobold Miners. Loot them for their Kobold Candles and Gold Dust"},
[64]={"Kill Kobold Tunnelers and Kobold Miners. Loot them for their Kobold Candles, Gold Dust and Lost Books"},
[66]={"Talk to \"Auntie\" Bernice Stonefield"},
[71]={"Kill Kobold Tunnelers and Kobold Miners. Loot them for their Kobold Candles and Gold Dust"},
[72]={"Kill Kobold Tunnelers and Kobold Miners. Loot them for their Kobold Candles, Gold Dust and Lost Books"},
[74]={"Enter one of the larger open spaces in Fargodeep Mine"},
[75]={"Kill Goldtooth. Loot him for Bernice's Necklace","Be careful as he usually pulls with the Kobold Miner next to him"},
[76]={"Kill Nimsy inside Fargodeep Mine. Loot him for the Picture Book: Fun with Elementals","Try to find a group for this step. The Kobolds respawn very fast in the cave","He will also summon a Rumbler add. Be careful if you're attempting to solo this. Skip this step if you are unable to kill him"},
[80]={"Talk to \"Auntie\" Bernice Stonefield"},
[82]={"Kill Stonetusk Boars. Loot them for their [Chunks of Boar Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the boars you're passing by"},
[85]={"Talk to Remy \"Two Times\"","Do NOT vendor the [Bag of Marbles] reward. This is an incredibly valuable item all the way through to level 60"},
[114]={"Kill Mangy Wolves. Loot them for their [Stringy Wolf Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the wolves you're passing by"},
[117]={"Loot the Fishing Nets in the water for the Half-Eaten Fish","These can be difficult to see"},
[119]={"Kill Murlocs and Murloc Streamrunners. Loot them for Crystal Kelp Fronds","Loot the Junk Piles on the ground for Shiny Junk. If you are unable to loot these due to too many Murlocs, skip this objective"},
[120]={"Kill Murlocs and Murloc Streamrunners. Loot them for Crystal Kelp Fronds"},
[121]={"Loot the Junk Piles on the ground for Shiny Junk","If you are unable to loot these due to too many Murlocs, skip this step"},
[128]={"Follow the path through middle to explore Jasperlode Mine"},
[129]={"Kill Geosculptor Yip. Loot him for the Geomancy for Curious Young Wizards","He will summon three Rumblers. Skip this step if you are unable to kill him"},
[130]={"Kill Mother Fang. Loot her for the Arcane Explainer: Magical Stuff in Simple Words","She Nets and Poisons. Skip this step if you are unable to kill her"},
[139]={"Kill Gray Forest Wolves. Loot them for their [Stringy Wolf Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the wolves you're passing by"},
[142]={"Kill Prowlers and Young Forest Bears","Prioritize killing any Young Forest Bears you see"},
[144]={"Kill Gray Forest Wolves and Prowlers. Loot them for their [Stringy Wolf Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the wolves you're passing by"},
[145]={"Click A half-eaten body on the ground"},
[147]={"Kill Prowlers. Loot them for their [Stringy Wolf Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the wolves you're passing by"},
[150]={"Kill Prowlers. Loot them for their [Stringy Wolf Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the wolves you're passing by"},
[151]={"Kill Prowlers. Loot them for their [Stringy Wolf Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the wolves you're passing by"},
[152]={"Kill Prowlers and Young Forest Bears","Prioritize killing any Young Forest Bears you see"},
[153]={"Loot the Bundles of Wood on the ground at the base of the trees"},
[154]={"Run on top of Rolf's corpse, then cast [Divine Protection] and then immediately click Rolf's corpse","Run away and reset the Murlocs after completing the quest"},
[155]={"Click Rolf's corpse on the ground","Be careful as Murloc Foragers will cast [Drink Minor Potion] which heals themselves for 61-68 health","Pull the 2 Murlocs in front of the huts, move away and nuke one of them down fast. Use [Divine Protection] and your Heals as required. This is a good opportunity to use [Bag of Marbles]. Run away and reset once you've killed one","Remember during [Divine Protection] you are unable to attack"},
[156]={"Click Rolf's corpse on the ground","Be careful as Murloc Foragers will cast [Drink Minor Potion] which heals themselves for 61-68 health","Cast [Renew] and [Power Word: Shield] then get full mana. Pull the 2 Murlocs in front of the huts, move away, then nuke one. Run away when you kill one, then kill the other","Pull the 2 Murlocs in front of the huts, move away and [Polymorph] one whilst killing the other. Kill the [Polymorphed] one after","Pool 100 Rage. Pull the 2 Murlocs in front of the huts, move away and keep [Hamstring] on one whilst killing the other. Also use [Bag of Marbles] on the one you're killing. Run away and reset the one being kited with [Hamstring] after you've killed one","Pull the 2 Murlocs in front of the huts, move away and focus killing one of them. Use [Evasion] once they're both attacking you. This is a good opportunity to use [Bag of Marbles]. Run away and reset once you've killed one","Pull the 2 Murlocs in front of the huts, move away and cast [Fear] on one of them constantly, and try to keep DoTs on both"},
[158]={"Kill Prowlers. Loot them for their [Stringy Wolf Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the wolves you're passing by"},
[159]={"Kill Prowlers and Young Forest Bears","Prioritize killing any Young Forest Bears you see"},
[160]={"Loot the Bundles of Wood on the ground at the base of the trees"},
[164]={"Kill Prowlers. Loot them for their [Stringy Wolf Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the wolves you're passing by"},
[165]={"Kill Prowlers and Young Forest Bears"},
[167]={"Loot the Waterlogged Saw on the ground"},
[168]={"Loot the Waterlogged Axe on the ground"},
[169]={"Loot the Waterlogged Toolbox on the ground"},
[170]={"Kill Croaky. Loot him for [Croaky's Head]","Use [Croaky's Head] to start the quest","He is a level 11 elite. Skip this step if you are unable to kill him"},
[171]={"Kill Prowlers and Young Forest Bears"},
[172]={"Kill Defias Bandits. Loot them for the [Westfall Deed]","Use the [Westfall Deed] to start the quest","The [Westfall Deed] is a very rare drop. Ignore this step if you don't get it"},
[173]={"Kill Defias Bandits. Loot them for their Red Linen Bandanas"},
[174]={"Kill Princess. Loot her for her Collar","Princess will aggro with both of her Porcine Entourage","Princess will also cast [Rushing Charge] which deals heavy damage","Pool 100 Rage before you engage Princess","Be sure [Evasion] is ready. If you're struggling, you can use the Fence with Throwing Weapons to abuse pathing and buy time","Be ready to use a [Lesser Healing Potion]"},
[175]={"Kill Defias Bandits. Loot them for their Red Linen Bandanas"},
[186]={"Kill Prowlers. Loot them for their [Stringy Wolf Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the wolves you're passing by"},
[198]={"Only train [Dual Wield] and [Sprint]. Do not train other spells to save your money for later"},
[208]={"Use the [Taming Rod] on a Rockhide Boar"},
[210]={"Use the [Taming Rod] on a Gray Forest Wolf","Ensure you have dismissed your previous Rockhide Boar"},
[212]={"Use the [Taming Rod] on a Young Forest Bear","Ensure you have dismissed your previous Gray Forest Wolf"},
[216]={"Do not train as you need to save your money for later"},
[225]={"Talk to Remy \"Two Times\""},
[227]={"Kill Stonetusk Boars. Loot them for their [Chunks of Boar Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the boars you're passing by"},
[234]={"Click the Wanted Poster"},
[235]={"Kill Riverpaw Runts and Riverpaw Outrunners. Loot them for the [Gold Pickup Schedule]","Use the [Gold Pickup Schedule] to start the quest","The [Gold Pickup Schedule] is a very rare drop. Ignore this step if you don't get it","Gruff Swiftbite a rare spawn, does have a 100% drop chance"},
[236]={"Kill Riverpaw Runts and Riverpaw Outrunners. Loot them for their Armbands"},
[237]={"Kill Hogger. Loot him for his Claw","Hogger can spawn in multiple locations","Cast [Fear] on Hogger continously and use your regular DoTs to kill him","Kite him back to the guard tower if required ensuring you've done at least 50% damage to him"},
[238]={"Kill Riverpaw Runts and Riverpaw Outrunners. Loot them for their Armbands"},
[255]={"We choose the [Explosive Rockets] as the reward. It deals decent damage, and can be used for \"Split pulling\" which is incredibly useful"},
[256]={"Buy the [Keen Throwing Knives] from him"},
[257]={"Buy the [Balanced Throwing Daggers] from him"},
[263]={"Buy a [Hatchet] from him. Equip it later when you're level 11","Alternatively, check the Auction House for something better or cheaper","Make sure you save 6s for training later"},
[264]={"Buy a [Hatchet] from him","Alternatively, check the Auction House for something better or cheaper","Make sure you save 6s for training later"},
[267]={"Buy and equip a [Laminated Recurve Bow]"},
[278]={"Kill Rockhide Boars. Loot them for their [Chunks of Boar Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the boars you're passing by"},
[280]={"Kill Defias Bandits. Loot them for the [Westfall Deed]","Use the [Westfall Deed] to start the quest","The [Westfall Deed] is a very rare drop. Ignore this step if you don't get it"},
[281]={"Kill Defias Bandits. Loot them for their Red Linen Bandanas"},
[282]={"Kill Surena Caledon. Loot her for her Choker","Focus on killing Surena Caledon very quickly","Cast [Fear] on Morgan the Collector continously"},
[284]={"Kill Prowlers. Loot them for their [Stringy Wolf Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the wolves you're passing by"},
[290]={"STICK TO THE MAIN ROAD AND AVOID ANY CLOSE MOBS EN-ROUTE"},
[296]={"Travel to the bottom of The Slaughtered Lamb"},
[297]={"Kill the Summoned Voidwalker"},
[299]={"Only train [Dual Wield] and [Sprint]"},
[305]={"Attack Bartleby. He will submit at 1%"},
[313]={"You'll train [Mining] later"},
[315]={"Take the Deeprun Tram to the Ironforge side","Level your [First Aid] while waiting for the Tram to Ironforge if needed","You will need your [First Aid] to be 80 for a quest at level 24","Cast [Summon Voidwalker] and [Create Healthstone] while waiting for the Tram to Ironforge if needed","Talk to Monty on the middle platform on the Ironforge side of the Deeprun Tram"},
[316]={"Use the [Rat Catcher's Flute] on Deeprun Rats inside the Deeprun Tram"},
[320]={"Ensure you save 20s 70c for later"},
[323]={"Buy the [Keen Throwing Knives] from her"},
[324]={"Buy the [Balanced Throwing Daggers] from her"},
[334]={"Exit Ironforge"},
[336]={"Kill Elder Crag Boars. Loot them for their [Chunks of Boar Meat]","This will be used to level your [Cooking] later","You need 10 [Cooking] for a quest in Auberdine later"},
[337]={"Kill Elder Crag Boars. Loot them for their [Chunks of Boar Meat]","This will be used to level your [Cooking] later","You need 50 [Cooking] for a quest in Darkshire later","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the boars you're passing by"},
[342]={"Kill Vagash. Loot him for his Fang","Kite him to the guard south of the ranch. Make sure you do 51%+ damage to him","Watch the video below before you attempt to kill Vagash. It can be soloed on any class"},
[345]={"Kill Large Crag Boars. Loot them for their [Chunks of Boar Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the boars you're passing by"},
[347]={"You can cancel the Farsight once the objective completes"},
[349]={"Press ESCAPE to cancel the Farsight"},
[353]={"This is used in conjunction with [Blacksmithing] to make [Rough Sharpening Stones] and [Rough Weightstones] to increase your weapon damage","If you don't want to do this, skip this step"},
[355]={"Kill Rockjaw Skullthumpers and Rockjaw Bonesnappers inside the cave. Loot them for the [Empty Powder Keg]","Use the [Empty Powder Keg] to start the quest","NOTE: This item has a low drop rate. Skip this step if you do not find it"},
[360]={"Kill Rockjaw Ambushers. Loot them for their Stolen Blasting Powder"},
[361]={"Kill Rockjaw Ambushers. Loot them for the [Empty Powder Keg]","Use the [Empty Powder Keg] to start the quest","NOTE: This item has a low drop rate. Skip this step if you do not find it by the time you are done with the Dark Iron Spies"},
[362]={"Kill Dark Iron Spies. Loot them for the [Dark Iron Map]","Use the [Dark Iron Map] to start the quest"},
[363]={"Kill Rockjaw Ambushers. Loot them for their Stolen Blasting Powder"},
[368]={"Kill Rockjaw Ambushers. Loot them for their Stolen Blasting Powder"},
[371]={"Click the Dwarven Corpse on the ground"},
[372]={"Kill Mangeclaw. Loot him for his Claw"},
