[53]={"Kill all types of Wendigos. Loot them for their Wendigo Manes","Loot Flintfire's Shipments on the ground inside the Grizzled Den cave"},
[55]={"Travel to the corpse of Mountaineer Cornelius inside the Grizzled Den cave","Be careful of the higher level Wendigos deeper in the cave"},
