{name="11-12 Elwynn (Dwarf/Gnome)",lo=11,hi=12,next="12-14 Loch Modan (Dwarf/Gnome)",tips={
[7]={"Prioritize training [Dual Wield]"},
[8]={"Talk to Remy \"Two Times\""},
[11]={"Click the Wanted Poster"},
[12]={"The [Gold Pickup Schedule] is a very rare drop. Ignore this step if you don't get it","Gruff Swiftbite a rare spawn, does have a 100% drop chance","Use the [Gold Pickup Schedule] to start the quest"},
[13]={"Kill Hogger. Loot him for his Claw","Hogger can spawn in multiple locations","Cast [Fear] on Hogger continously and use your regular DoTs to kill him","This quest is difficult. Find a group for him if needed. Skip this step if you're unable to find a group or solo him"},
[15]={"Kill Princess. Loot her for her Collar","Princess will aggro with both of her Porcine Entourage","Princess will also cast [Rushing Charge] which deals heavy damage","Pool 100 Rage before you engage Princess","Be sure [Evasion] is ready. If you're struggling, you can use the Fence with Throwing Weapons to abuse pathing and buy time","Be ready to use a [Lesser Healing Potion]"},
[16]={"Kill Surena Caledon. Loot her for her Choker","Kill Morgan the Collector. Loot him for The Collector's Ring","Focus on killing Surena Caledon very quickly","Cast [Fear] on Morgan the Collector continously"},
[17]={"Kill Surena Caledon. Loot her for her Choker","Focus on killing Surena Caledon very quickly","Cast [Fear] on Morgan the Collector continously"},
[20]={"Kill Prowlers and Young Forest Bears","Prioritize killing any Young Forest Bears you see"},
[21]={"Click A half-eaten body on the ground"},
[23]={"Loot the Bundle of Wood on the ground. They are found beneath the trees"},
[24]={"Click Rolf's corpse on the ground","Be careful as nearby Murlocs may aggro once you click Rolf's corpse","Murloc Foragers will cast [Drink Minor Potion] which heals themselves for 61-68"},
[25]={"Loot the Bundles of Wood on the ground at the base of the trees"},
[27]={"Kill Prowlers and Young Forest Bears"},
[29]={"Loot the Waterlogged Saw on the ground"},
[30]={"Loot the Waterlogged Axe on the ground"},
[31]={"Loot the Waterlogged Toolbox on the ground"},
[32]={"Kill Croaky. Loot him for [Croaky's Head]","Use [Croaky's Head] to start the quest","He is a level 11 elite. Skip this step if you are unable to kill him"},
[33]={"Kill Prowlers and Young Forest Bears"},
[40]={"Be careful of high level mobs en route"},
[42]={"We choose the [Explosive Rockets] as the reward. It deals decent damage, and can be used for \"Split pulling\" which is incredibly useful"},
[47]={"Travel to the bottom of The Slaughtered Lamb"},
[48]={"Kill the Summoned Voidwalker"},
[63]={"Kill Riverpaw Runts and Riverpaw Outrunners. Loot them for [Linen Cloth]","Ensure you have 10 [Linen Cloth] for your upcoming Paladin class quest"},
[76]={"Buy food/water if needed","Buy food if needed"},
[78]={"Buy food/water if needed","Buy food if needed"},
