{name="12-14 Loch Modan (Dwarf/Gnome)",lo=12,hi=14,next="13-15 Westfall",tips={
[5]={"Use the [The Tome of Divinity] to start the quest"},
[7]={"John Turner patrols along the outer ring of Ironforge between just past the Stonefire Tavern and just past the Visitor's Center"},
[19]={"Use the [Ceramic Jar] while standing on the snowy patch to collect the [Jar of Snow]"},
[27]={"Kill Mountain Boars. Loot them for their [Chunks of Boar Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the boars you're passing by"},
[29]={"Ensure to turn this in before the 10 minute expiry on the [Jar of Snow]"},
[30]={"Kill Stonesplinter Seers. Loot them for their Reagent Pouch"},
[31]={"Kill Tunnel Rats. Loot them for their Ears","Kill Tunnel Rat Geomancers. Loot them for their Fire Tar","Tunnel Rat Geomancers are only found inside the mine"},
[33]={"Open the Miners' League Crates inside the mine. Loot them for the Miners' Gear"},
[34]={"Buy the [Heavy Spiked Mace] OR the [Ironwood Maul] from him (if they're up)","If you can't afford this, then grind money from the nearby Tunnel Rats until you have enough","Do this quickly as another player may purchase it before you do","If you don't wish to do this or would rather try to buy a cheaper/better weapon from the AH soon instead, skip this step"},
[37]={"Kill Tunnel Rats. Loot them for their Ears","Kill Tunnel Rat Geomancers. Loot them for their Fire Tar","Tunnel Rat Geomancers are only found inside the mine"},
[39]={"Kill Mountain Boars. Loot them for their [Chunks of Boar Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the boars you're passing by"},
[45]={"Kill Mountain Boars. Loot them for their [Chunks of Boar Meat]","Don't go out of your way to farm this now. Simply kill and loot all the boars you're passing by"},
[46]={"Kill Elder Black Bears. Loot them for their Bear Meat","Kill Mountain Boars. Loot them for their Boar Intestines","Kill Forest Lurkers. Loot them for their Ichor"},
[47]={"Mountaineer Kadrell patrols the road through Thelsamar"},
[50]={"Buy a [Simple Wood] and a [Flint and Tinder] from her","This is used to make [Basic Campfires] on Boats to level your [Cooking] skill without losing time","You need 50 [Cooking] for a quest in Duskwood later"},
[51]={"Mountaineer Kadrell patrols the road through Thelsamar"},
[52]={"Kill Stonesplinter Troggs and Stonesplinter Scouts. Loot them for their Trogg Stone Teeth","Be careful as Stonesplinter Scouts cast [Shoot] (Ranged Cast: Deals 14-20 damage)","This is a hyperspawn area. You should not need to move from here"},
[53]={"If you're planning on running the Hall of Thanes dungeon in Ironforge later, skip this step"},
[56]={"Continue up the trail","Use the [Fire Sapta] next to the rock statue to summon the Minor Manifestation of Fire"},
[57]={"Kill the Minor Manifestation of Fire. Loot it for the Glowing Ember"},
[58]={"Click the Brazier of the Dormant Flame"},
[66]={"Click the Discarded Fishing Toolbox on the lake floor","NOTE: This can spawn in one of many different locations. Swim around until you see the exclamation point on your minimap","Be careful of high level Young Threshadon"},
[72]={"Kill Dark Iron Spies. Loot them for the Dark Iron Script"},
[95]={"Buy up to 2 [Scimitars] from her if you can afford it or something better from the Auction House"},
[100]={"Buy a [Smoldering Wand] from her"},
