[131]={"Kill Witchmother Arysa. Loot her for her [Amulet]","Witchmother Arysa and Bloodfeather Matriarchs cast [Healing Wave] and [Lightning Bolt] which does a lot of damage. Try to burst them fast","Avoid fighting the Matriarchs as much as you can"},
