{name="16-19 Darkshore",lo=16,hi=19,next="19-20 Redridge",tips={
[1]={"Click the Wanted Poster"},
[6]={"Kill Anaya Dawnrunner. Loot her for her Pendant"},
[7]={"Kill Anaya Dawnrunner. Loot her for her Pendant"},
[8]={"Kill Moonstalker Runts and Moonstalkers. Loot them for their Moonstalker Fangs"},
[9]={"Kill Rabid Thistle Bears in southern Darkshore","Be careful as they cast [Rabies] if you dont kill them fast enough (Instant Melee: Reduces all health regeneration by 50% for 10 minutes)"},
[10]={"Collect 5 [Earthroot] as you quest"},
[11]={"Loot Lunar Fungi on the ground throughout caves"},
[14]={"Kill Moonstalker Sires. Loot them for their Pelts","Care as they can cast [Exploit Weakness] a backstab attack dealing 20-40 damage if you turn your back to them"},
[15]={"Kill Grizzled Thistle Bears. Loot them for their Scalps","Be careful as they cast [Ravage] an instant attack dealing 20-40 damage and knocking you down for 2 seconds"},
[16]={"Click the Buzzbox 525 on the ground"},
[19]={"Discover The Master's Glaive"},
[21]={"Click the Scrying Bowl on the ground"},
[22]={"Click the Twilight Tome on the northern pedestal"},
[23]={"Kill Twilight Disciples and Twilight Thugs. Loot them for the Peerless Eye and [Book: The Powers Below]","Be careful as Twilight Thugs can [Disarm] you for 6 seconds","Be careful as Twilight Disciples cast [Renew] and a 3 second [Heal]"},
[24]={"Talk to Therylune. This will start an escort","Skip this step if she is not there"},
[25]={"Escort Therylune out of The Masters Glaive"},
[26]={"Kill Twilight Disciples and Twilight Thugs. Loot them for the Peerless Eye and [Book: The Powers Below]","Be careful as Twilight Thugs can [Disarm] you for 6 seconds","Be careful as Twilight Disciples cast [Renew] and a 3 second [Heal]"},
[28]={"Kill Moonstalker Sires. Loot them for their Pelts","Be careful as they can cast [Exploit Weakness] a backstab attack dealing 20-40 damage if you turn your back to them"},
[29]={"Kill Grizzled Thistle Bears. Loot them for their Scalps","Be careful as they cast [Ravage] an instant attack dealing 20-40 damage and knocking you down for 2 seconds"},
[30]={"Click the Buzzbox 525 on the ground"},
[32]={"Use the [Book: The Powers Below] to start the quest"},
[34]={"You may have to wait for him to respawn or for others to finish the escort"},
[35]={"Talk to Prospector Remtravel. This will start an escort","This quest is VERY difficult. You can skip this step and come back at level 19"},
[36]={"Escort Prospector Remtravel through the Excavation","This quest is VERY difficult. You can skip this step and come back at level 19"},
[37]={"Click the Beached Sea Creature","This quest can be VERY difficult. Engage the Murlocs 1 by 1, otherwise you may aggro multiple at the same time","Be aware of Greymist Oracles' [Lightning Bolt] damage, they can also heal with [Healing Wave]"},
[38]={"Kill Encrusted Tide Crawlers and Reef Crawlers. Loot them for their Fine Crab Chunks","Be careful as Reef Crawlers can cast [Muscle Tear] an instant attack dealing 30-55 damage"},
[39]={"Be aware of Greymist Oracles' [Lightning Bolt] damage, they can also heal with [Healing Wave]","Care as Greymist Tidehunters can cast [Poison] while in melee leaving a dot dealing 13 damage per 3 seconds for 30 seconds","Click the Beached Sea Turtle"},
[40]={"Be aware of Greymist Oracles' [Lightning Bolt] damage, they can also heal with [Healing Wave]","Care as Greymist Tidehunters can cast [Poison] while in melee leaving a dot dealing 13 damage per 3 seconds for 30 seconds","Click the Beached Sea Turtle"},
[41]={"Click the Beached Sea Creature"},
[42]={"Click the Beached Sea Creature"},
[43]={"Finish collecting the [Earthroot] via [Herbalism] and rarely Battered Chests","If you give up and can't find enough, skip this step"},
[44]={"Make sure you check if Murkdeep is already up in the water (if someone has previously failed the encounter or left the Greymist Hunter in the wave that he spawns with alive)","Kill the Greymist Warriors and Greymist Hunters in the camp","Move to the Bonfire in the center of the camp to start the Murkdeep encounter:","3 waves will spawn from the water, each after killing the previous wave: Wave 1 has 3 level 12-13 Greymist Coastrunners, Wave 2 has 2 level 15-16 Greymist Warriors, and Wave 3 has a level 19 Murkdeep and a level 16-17 Greymist Hunter. You can move away from the Bonfire to avoid aggroing the next wave"},
[45]={"Click the Beached Sea Creature"},
[47]={"Go to Moonglade"},
[64]={"Open the Blackwood Grain Stores. Loot it for the [Blackwood Grain Sample]","Looting this will spawn 2 Blackwood Furbolgs that will aggro and run towards you. Be ready to fight them or reset them","If you see Xabraxxis yell in chat or see someone fighting him, help them. Open the Xabraxxis' Demon Bag he drops on the ground. Loot it for the Talisman of Corruption"},
[65]={"Kill Den Mother","Be careful as the Thistle Cubs can cast [Ravage], a melee instant attack which stuns you for 2 seconds"},
[66]={"Open the Blackwood Nut Stores. Loot it for the [Blackwood Nut Sample]","Looting this will spawn 2 Blackwood Furbolgs that will aggro and run towards you. Be ready to fight them or reset them","If you see Xabraxxis yell in chat or see someone fighting him, help them. Open the Xabraxxis' Demon Bag he drops on the ground. Loot it for the Talisman of Corruption"},
[67]={"Open the Blackwood Fruit Stores. Loot it for the [Blackwood Fruit Sample]","Looting this will spawn 2 Blackwood Furbolgs that will aggro and run towards you. Be ready to fight them or reset them","If you see Xabraxxis yell in chat or see someone fighting him, help them. Open the Xabraxxis' Demon Bag he drops on the ground. Loot it for the Talisman of Corruption"},
[69]={"Kill Xabraxxis. Open the Xabraxxis' Demon Bag he drops on the ground. Loot it for the Talisman of Corruption"},
[71]={"Make sure your HS cooldown is <10 min","Skip this step if the area is too crowded"},
[72]={"Kill Moonstalker Runts and Moonstalkers. Loot them for their Moonstalker Fangs"},
[73]={"Click the Buzzbox 323 on the ground"},
[74]={"Click the Buzzbox 323 on the ground"},
[76]={"Kill Dark Strand Fanatics. Loot them for their Worn Parchments"},
[78]={"Loot the Mathystra Relics on the ground"},
[80]={"Kill Raging Reef Crawlers and Encrusted Tide Crawlers. Loot them for the Bottom of Gelkak's Key","Be aware of Raging Reef Crawlers' [Thrash] ability. You can take 200 damage instantly from their melee hits"},
[81]={"Kill Greymist Oracles and Greymist Tidehunters. Loot them for the Middle of Gelkak's Key","Be aware of Greymist Oracles' [Lightning Bolt] damage and they can also heal with [Healing Wave]","Care as Greymist Tidehunters can cast [Poison] while in melee leaving a dot dealing 13 damage per 3 seconds for 30 seconds","You can LoS (Line of Sight) the Greymist Oracles' [Lightning Bolts] around the sunken ship to avoid taking its damage"},
[82]={"Kill Raging Reef Crawlers and Encrusted Tide Crawlers. Loot them for the Bottom of Gelkak's Key","Be aware of Raging Reef Crawlers' [Thrash] ability. You can take 200 damage instantly from their melee hits"},
[83]={"Kill Giant Foreststriders. Loot them for the Top of Gelkak's Key"},
[84]={"Kill Moonstalker Sires and Moonstalker Matriarchs. Loot them for their Pelts","Be aware of Moonstalker Matriarchs. They always attack with a Moonstalker Runt by their side","Moonstalker Sires can cast [Exploit Weakness] a backstab attack dealing 20-40 damage if you turn your back to them"},
[85]={"Start looking for a group for Gyromast's Revenge/The Threshwackonator 4100"},
[86]={"Start looking for a group for Gyromast's Revenge/The Threshwackonator 4100"},
[87]={"This quest is VERY difficult"},
[88]={"Click the Beached Sea Turtle"},
[89]={"Escort The Threshwackonator 4100 to Gelkak Gyromast","Kill The Threshwackonator 4100 once it turns hostile","This quest is VERY difficult","Only use ranged attacks while running from it, avoid being at melee range","Try to do this quest if you can as it'll save you time later as it rewards [Draught of Water Breathing] for underwater quests later","Use [Entangling Roots] on him when he turns hostile then create distance and kite using instant cast spells","If you are unable to kill the The Threshwackonator 4100, skip this step"},
[92]={"Kill Encrusted Tide Crawlers. Loot them for their Fine Crab Chunks"},
[96]={"Click the Beached Sea Turtle"},
[97]={"Swim out in the water","Open the Strange Lockbox. Loot it for the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility"},
[117]={"Buy a [Heavy Recurve Bow] and a [Medium Quiver] from her"},
[136]={"Buy a [Flint and Tinder] and a [Simple Wood] from him","This is for leveling up your [Cooking] while on the boat soon","You need 50 [Cooking] for a quest in Duskwood later"},
[141]={"Level your [First Aid] while waiting for the boat"},
[142]={"This is a limited supply item. Skip this step if Neal Allen doesn't have one"},
[146]={"This is a limited supply item. Skip this step if Gearcutter Cogspinner doesn't have one"},
[147]={"Level your [First Aid] if needed while waiting for the tram","You will need your [First Aid] to be 80 for a quest at level 24"},
