{name="19-20 Redridge",lo=19,hi=20,next="20-21 Darkshore/Ashenvale",tips={
[1]={"This is a limited supply item. Skip this step if Billibub Cogspinner doesn't have one"},
[10]={"Buy a [Burning Wand] if it's an upgrade","It's important to buy a non-shadow damage wand. You'll have to deal with mobs resistant to shadow damage later"},
[19]={"This is a limited supply item. Skip this step if Billibub Cogspinner doesn't have one"},
[21]={"Ensure you train [Lockpicking] as well as you will need it for your Rogue class quest soon"},
[23]={"Talk to Renzik \"The Shiv\""},
[26]={"Buy a [Kris] or something better from the Auction House","Equip it once you're level 19"},
[30]={"Use the [Gatehouse Shipment] in front of the Gatehouse Door upstairs"},
[41]={"Click the Wanted Poster"},
[44]={"Darcy walks around inside the Inn"},
[48]={"Kill Bellygrub. Loot him for his Tusk","Kite Bellygrub back to Lakeshire so the Guards assist you in killing Bellygrub","This quest is VERY difficult. You can skip this step and come back later"},
[52]={"Jump into the Lake","Open the Glinting Mud. Loot it for Hilary's Necklace","It has multiple spawn locations in the Lake"},
[54]={"Open the Sunken Chest. Loot it for Oslow's Toolbox"},
[59]={"Kill Redridge Mongrels and Redridge Poachers","Kill Redridge Thrashers. Loot them for their Spiked Collars"},
[61]={"Kill Redridge Mongrels and Redridge Poachers","Kill Redridge Thrashers. Loot them for their Spiked Collars"},
[62]={"Kill Murloc Shorestrikers and Murloc Minor Tidecallers. Loot them for their Fins and Sunfish","Be aware this area is a hyperspawn, meaning the Murlocs respawn quickly"},
[63]={"Kill Dire Condors. Loot them for their Tough Condor Meat","Skip this step if you aren't seeing any Dire Condors"},
[64]={"Kill Incinerator Gar'im inside the cave. Loot him for the Broken Staff of Incinerator Gar'im","Skip this step if you are unable to find a group for him"},
[65]={"Loot the Grain Sacks and Meat Haunches on the ground for Stolen Supplies","Loot the Weapon Racks and Stolen Weapons the ground"},
[66]={"Kill Blackrock Grunts and Blackrock Outrunners. Loot them for their Axes","Be aware the Blackrock Outrunners will cast [Net] on you"},
[67]={"Loot the Grain Sacks and Meat Haunches on the ground for Stolen Supplies","Loot the Weapon Racks and Stolen Weapons the ground"},
[69]={"Jump into the Lake","Open the Sunken Chest. Loot it for Oslow's Toolbox"},
[72]={"You MUST do this for your [Poisons] quest later","Stand on the waypoint location. Position your camera and cursor until you can click 3 Practice Lockboxes at once without having to move anything"},
[73]={"Open Lucius's Lockbox. Loot it for the Token of Thievery"},
[83]={"Darcy walks around inside the Inn"},
[98]={"Go deep into the cave, travel across the bridge, look for a cat statue inside an alcove and click on the small orb next to the statue","Loot Relic of the Claw"},
[99]={"Click on the small orb next to the cat statue","Loot Relic of the Silent Shadow"},
[100]={"Click on the small orb next to the cat statue","Loot Relic of the Fang"},
[103]={"Teleport to Moonglade and talk to Dendrite Starblaze"},
[109]={"Buy a [Longsword] and equip it at 21","Buy something from the Auction House if there's something cheaper/better"},
[114]={"Buy a [Dacian Falx] if you have enough money. Equip it at 21","Buy something from the Auction House if there's something cheaper/better"},
[124]={"Talk to Duthorian Rall. He will give you the [Tome of Valor]","Use the [Tome of Valor] to start the quest"},
[132]={"Fly there if you already have the Westfall Flight Path"},
[135]={"Kill Pygmy Venom Web Spiders and Venom Web Spiders. Loot them for a Small Venom Sac and their Gooey Spider Legs","You need a Small Venom Sac to make an [Anti-Venom] later to remove the [Touch of Zanzil] debuff later","Save the Gooey Spider Legs for later","If you have a Paladin, Druid or Shaman friend you can skip this step and ask them to remove it for you"},
[137]={"You MUST complete this quest to unlock [Poisons]."},
[138]={"[Pick Pocket] the Malformed Defias Drone. Loot it for the Defias Tower Key","You must be in [Stealth] to use [Pick Pocket]","The Malformed Defias Drone spawns at the entrance to the tower, then patrols around the outside of it","Be careful as he deals a LOT of damage. If your [Stealth] breaks, quickly use [Sprint] and run away"},
[140]={"Travel up to 2nd top floor of the tower. Whilst in [Stealth] and the Defias Tower Sentries aren't next to you, Jump onto the chair, then onto the lamp, then onto the bookshelf on top of the waypoint location","Manually [Unstealth], then press your \"Interact with Target\" keybind to open the Duskwood Chest. Loot it for Klaven Mortwake's Journal","NOTE: Your [Stealth] will temporarily stop working after looting Klaven Mortwake's Journal","Be prepared to run if you don't kill the Defias Tower Sentries on the 2nd floor. They will most likely aggro you permanently (but not attack you) when you are on top of the bookshelf as it is an evade spot","If you have a [Dagger] in your bags or equipped, you can cast [Ambush] on the Defias Tower Patrollers and Defias Tower Sentries inside to kill them instantly. Be prepared to run after you kill the first Defias Tower Sentry and remember you can be hit from above. This is slower, but a LOT safer","Be careful as the Malformed Defias Drone and Defias Drones can be at the entrance of the tower if you have to run out of it"},
[146]={"If you have a Paladin, Druid or Shaman friend, ask them to remove the [Touch of Zanzil] for you instead"},
[147]={"If you have a Paladin, Druid or Shaman friend, ask them to remove the [Touch of Zanzil] for you instead"},
[151]={"Remember to re-equip your main weapon if you switched to a [Dagger] earlier"},
[157]={"If you're in Goldshire it will be faster to Fly from Stormwind","If you're at the Tower of Azora simply run to Redridge"},
[165]={"Kill Black Dragon Whelps. Loot them for their Scales"},
[166]={"Kill Great Goretusks. Loot them for their Great Goretusk Snouts","Save any [Chunks of Boar Meat] you loot as well as you can use them to level [Cooking] to 50 which is required for Duskwood later"},
[167]={"Kill Black Dragon Whelps. Loot them for their Scales"},
[168]={"Kill Redridge Brutes and Redridge Mystics. Loot them for their Iron Pikes and Iron Rivets"},
[169]={"Kill Black Dragon Whelps. Loot them for their Scales"},
[170]={"Darcy walks around inside the Inn"},
[171]={"Level up your [Cooking] using the [Chunks of Boar Meat] you farmed earlier. You need level 50 [Cooking]","If you need more [Chunks of Boar Meat] travel to the west near Bellygrub and kill more Great Goretusks"},
