[33]={"Kill Starving Dire Wolves and Rabid Dire Wolves en route. Loot them for their Lean Wolf Flanks","Be careful as Starving Dire Wolves have [Increased Aggro Range] and Rabid Dire Wolves cast [Rabies] (Reduces ALL health regen by 50%)","You don't have to kill all Wolves now. Save the Lean Wolf Flanks for a later quest"},
[34]={"Kill Starving Dire Wolves and Rabid Dire Wolves en route","Be careful as Starving Dire Wolves have [Increased Aggro Range] and Rabid Dire Wolves cast [Rabies] (Reduces ALL health regen by 50%)","You don't have to kill all Wolves now"},
