[142]={"She may be dead or busy fighting Stitches if he attacks Darkshire. If that happens consider grinding mobs near the town until she respawns or changing your layer (if possible)"},
[145]={"Talk to Watcher Ladimore she patrols around the Darkshire main square","Watcher Ladimore patrols around in Darkshire"},
