[164]={"Defeat Dashel Stonefist","Dashel Stonefist will also attack with 2 Old Town Thugs. Ignore them and focus on Dashel Stonefist","Be careful as the Old Town Thugs will reset when you defeat Dashel but then become hostile again after returning to their original locations"},
