{name="32-33 Hillsbrad/Arathi",lo=32,hi=33,next="33-34 Thousand Needles",tips={
[2]={"Accepting this quest will make Tapoke \"Slim\" Jahn by the Inn entrance [Stealth] and run away outside"},
[3]={"Quickly run outside!","Defeat Tapoke \"Slim\" Jahn. Slim's Friend will run away once Tapoke \"Slim\" Jahn submits","Use any Crowd Control (CC) on Slim's Friend if needed"},
[4]={"Buy a [Flagon of Dwarven Honeymead] from him"},
[5]={"Wait out the RP"},
[6]={"Talk to Tapoke \"Slim\" Jahn"},
[10]={"The Shadowy Assassin attack on Southshore is a random event","If you ever see a Shadowy Assassin in Southshore, kill them. Loot them for the [Assassin's Contract]","Use the [Assassin's Contract] to start the quest","Skip this step if you don't see the event"},
[16]={"Kill Torn Fin Tidehunters and Torn Fin Oracles"},
[18]={"Kill Torn Fin Tidehunters, Torn Fin Oracles, Torn Fin Coastrunners and Torn Fin Muckdwellers. Loot them for their Heads"},
[22]={"Don't accept the follow up"},
[24]={"Kill Daggerspine Sirens and Daggerspine Shorehunters","You may need to swim out in the water for them"},
[26]={"Buy 4 [Soothing Spices] and 1 [Fine Thread] from him"},
[27]={"Buy 4 [Soothing Spices] from him"},
[31]={"Kill Yetis. Loot them for their Fur"},
[32]={"Loot the Alterac Granite on the ground","Alterac Granite spawns throughout the entire Cave"},
[33]={"Kill Yetis. Loot them for their Fur","If all of the Yetis are dead inside of the cave you may kill the Yetis to the north around Alterac Mountains as well"},
[35]={"Kill Mountain Lions and Hulking Mountain Lions","Check the westernmost hill for all spawns before you head east, kill all Hulking Mountain Lions you see as the objective is hard to complete if you skip mobs"},
[36]={"Kill Syndicate Thieves and Syndicate Footpads","Kill all Syndicate mobs you see in the camp on the hill west of the road. This quest objective may be hard to complete if you skip mobs and you'd have to backtrack"},
[37]={"Click the Syndicate Documents on the table"},
[38]={"Kill Syndicate Thieves and Syndicate Footpads"},
[39]={"Finish off kiling Mountain Lions keep killing any Hulking Mountain Lions you see"},
[40]={"Kill Snapjaws. Loot them for their Turtle Meat","Go up and down along the River until you've completed it","Be careful not to run into Narillasanz a level 44 elite red dragon that may be patroling around the area"},
[41]={"Finish off kiling Hulking Mountain Lions. If there's not enough spawns to complete the objective you can find more in the area north of Strahnbrad","Be careful not to run into Narillasanz a level 44 elite red dragon that may be patroling around the area"},
[44]={"Buy 1 [Fine Thread] from him"},
[45]={"Buy 1 [Soothing Spice] from him"},
[52]={"While on the flight path try to see if you fly over the Forsaken Courier. It travels the road from Go'shek farm to Tarren Mill. Knowing where it is will be useful for a quest soon"},
[55]={"Travel to Stromgarde Keep to further train your [First Aid]","Follow the Arrow very closely once you are inside, as there are a lot of Elite mobs in the Keep","Buy the [Expert First Aid - Under Wraps], [Manual: Heavy Silk Bandage] and [Manual: Mageweave Bandage] from him","Deneb Walker also has limited supply items such as [Scrolls] and [Potions] as well which you should buy"},
[56]={"Kill the Forsaken Courier. Loot her for her Sealed Folder","The Forsaken Courier spawns next to the Apothecary's hut in Go'shek farm (marked on your map) and walks all the way to Tarren Mill where it despawns.","It respawns about every 7 minutes after being killed or reaching Tarren Mill","Cast [Eagle Eye] to try and find the Forsaken Courier","If you can't see them in Arathi, look for them in Hillsbrad after finishing Northfold Manor"},
[57]={"Kill Syndicate Mercenaries and Syndicate Highwaymen","Be aware Syndicate Highwaymen are in [Stealth] and can be found around the perimiter of Northfold Manor","Cast [Perception] to help spot Syndicate Highwaymen"},
[58]={"Buy food/water if needed"},
[63]={"Cast [Eagle Eye] to try and find a Plains Creeper. Some of their locations are marked on your map","Cast [Tame Beast] on a Plains Creeper to tame it"},
[64]={"Don't go out of your way to find the Forsaken Courier. You can skip this step and finish it later"},
[66]={"Teleport to Moonglade"},
[67]={"Buy food/water if needed","Buy food if needed"},
