{name="33-34 Thousand Needles",lo=33,hi=34,next="34-35 Stranglethorn Vale I",tips={
[2]={"Level your [First Aid] while waiting"},
[11]={"Buy 3 [Soothing Spices] from her"},
[12]={"Stay in Archmage Tervosh's Line of Sight as he will buff you with [Proudmoore's Defense] which gives 10 Stamina and 40 Armor"},
[13]={"Talk to \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl"},
[14]={"Click the Loose Dirt"},
[15]={"IF YOU CHOOSE TO ACCEPT THE FOLLOW UP QUEST YOU WILL BE PVP FLAGGED! MEANING HORDE PLAYERS CAN KILL YOU! PROCEED AT YOUR OWN RISK!","You will NOT be PvP Flagged for turning in this current quest. Auto accept has been turned OFF for the follow up"},
[16]={"IF YOU CHOOSE TO ACCEPT THIS QUEST YOU WILL BE PVP FLAGGED! MEANING HORDE PLAYERS CAN KILL YOU! PROCEED AT YOUR OWN RISK!"},
[17]={"Blizzard has adjusted this quest so it will no longer PvP Flag you on Official Hardcore Servers"},
[19]={"Defeat Private Hendel. He will attack you along with 2 Theramore Sentries","They will both reset once you subdue Private Hendel"},
[23]={"Click the Hoofprints on the ground","Click the Theramore Guard Badge on the wooden plank","Click the Black Shield hanging on the fireplace"},
[24]={"Click the Burned-Out Remains on the ground"},
[25]={"Click the Nailed Plank on the tower"},
[28]={"Use [Henrig Lonebrow's Journal] to start the quest"},
[33]={"Kill Highperch Wyverns, Highperch Consorts and Highperch Patriarchs. Loot them for their Venom Sacs"},
[35]={"Don't accept the other quests yet"},
[40]={"Run circles around The Shimmering Flats until all objectives are complete","Kill Salt Flats Scavengers and Salt Flats Vultures. Loot them for their Bones","Kill Sparkleshell Tortoises, Sparkleshell Borers and Sparkleshell Snappers. Loot them for their Shells","Don't go out of your way to collect all Turtle Meat","Kill Scorpid Reavers and Scorpid Terrors. Loot them for their Venom","Kill Saltstone Basilisks, Saltstone Crystalhides and Saltstone Gazers","Loot Saltstone Basilisks for their Scales","Open the Rocket Car Rubble. Loot it for the Rocket Car Parts"},
[41]={"Run circles around The Shimmering Flats until all objectives are complete","Kill Salt Flats Scavengers and Salt Flats Vultures. Loot them for their Bones","Kill Sparkleshell Tortoises, Sparkleshell Borers and Sparkleshell Snappers. Loot them for their Shells","Don't go out of your way to collect all Turtle Meat","Kill Scorpid Reavers and Scorpid Terrors. Loot them for their Venom","Kill Saltstone Basilisks, Saltstone Crystalhides and Saltstone Gazers","Open the Rocket Car Rubble. Loot it for the Rocket Car Parts"},
[48]={"Buy food/water if needed","Buy food if needed"},
[59]={"Loot any Mirefin Murlocs you kill for [Mirefin Heads] for a quest later","Don't aim to complete this objective now, you will finish later"},
[63]={"Start the affray by stepping on the grate","Kill Affray Challengers until Big Will appears","Kill Big Will"},
[65]={"[Farren's Report]","[Cleverly Encrypted Letter] (If you found it)","[Alterac Granite]","[Mirefin Head]"},
[73]={"Level your [First Aid] while waiting"},
