[86]={"Kill Scorpashi Snappers, Scorpashi Lashers and Scorpashi Venomlashs. Loot them for their Venom"},
[88]={"Kill Scorpashi Snappers, Scorpashi Lashers and Scorpashi Venomlashs. Loot them for their Venom","You may need to kill Gritjaw Basilisks to force Scorpashi Snappers and Scorpashi Lashers to spawn","You must complete this step now"},
