{name="39-40 Alterac/Arathi",lo=39,hi=40,next="40-40 Dustwallow Marsh",tips={
[2]={"[Draught of Water Breathing]","[Decrypted Letter]","[Letter of Commendation]","[Karnitol's Satchel]","[Bag of Water Elemental Bracers]","[Encrusted Tail Fins]","[Mirefin Head]"},
[3]={"[Blue Pearls] (if you have any)","[Silk Cloth] (if you have any)","[Khadgar's Essays on Dimensional Convergence] (if you have it)"},
[4]={"Talk to Frederick Stover inside, on the upper level","Check if Frederick has a [Massive Longbow] in stock (it's a limited supply item, he won't always have it). If he has one, buy it. It is a VERY POWERFUL level 42+ weapon","Skip this step if he doesn't have one"},
[5]={"Buy a [Pitchwood Wand] from her if it's better than your current wand. Equip it at 40"},
[9]={"Ian Strom up stairs"},
[15]={"Level your [First Aid] if needed while waiting for the Tram"},
[23]={"Buy some [Shiny Fish Scales] from the Auction House. Buy a stack of 20 if they are cheap"},
[29]={"Click the Carved Figurine on the ledge"},
[30]={"Click the Carved Figurine on the ledge"},
[36]={"Click on the [Pendant of Myzrael] in your bags to accept the quest it gives"},
[37]={"Click the Shards of Myzrael"},
[38]={"Click the Shards of Myzrael"},
[40]={"Kill Drywhisker Kobolds, Drywhisker Diggers and Drywhisker Surveyors. Loot them for their Motes","The quest turn in for this is inside the Cave. Clear your way to the back while completing it"},
[41]={"Mine the Lesser Bloodstone Deposits. Loot it for Lesser Bloodstone Ore","These are found inside of the Cave"},
[42]={"Click the Iridescent Shards at the back of the Cave"},
[45]={"Open the Stone of East Binding. Loot it for the Cresting Key"},
[47]={"Kill the Witherbarks. Loot them for their Witherbark Tusks","Kill Witherbark Witch Doctors. Loot them for their Medicine Pouches","Kill Witherbark Shadow Hunters. Loot them for their Shadow Hunter Knife","Witherbark Shadow Hunters are only found inside the Cave marked on your map","Be careful as the Witherbark Headhunters can [Net] you for 10 seconds and have an [Execute] which they can cast when you're below 20% health"},
[49]={"Someone may be doing the Kinelory escort if she isn't there. Wait until she returns"},
[50]={"Escort Kinelory through Go'Shek Farm"},
[52]={"Kill the Forsaken Courier if you find her while questing. Loot her for her Sealed Folder","The Forsaken Courier patrols the road between Tarren Mill and Go'Shek Farm","You can cast [Eagle Eye] to try and find the Forsaken Courier"},
[54]={"Open the Stone of Outer Binding. Loot it for the Thundering Key"},
[59]={"Kill Kor'gresh Coldrage. Loot him for Trelane's Wand"},
[60]={"Do not accept the follow up yet"},
[62]={"The Shadowy Assassin attack on Southshore is a random event","If you ever see a Shadowy Assassin in Southshore, kill them. Loot them for the [Assassin's Contract]","Use the [Assassin's Contract] to start the quest","Skip this step if you don't see the event"},
[78]={"Kill Grel'borg the Miser. Loot him for the Perenolde Tiara","Grel'borg the Miser patrols the Ruins of Alterac. He is a level 39 Elite and easy to kill so long as you don't aggro additional mobs. His patrol route is marked on your map"},
[79]={"Enter the Town Hall","Open the Weathered Bookcase. Loot it for the Worn Leather Book","You may kill Muckrake or just CC him, loot and then run away","If you decide to fight him be careful as Muckrake has a [Disarm]"},
[81]={"Kill the Syndicate. Loot them for their Signet Rings","Syndicate Assassins and Syndicate Spies will be in [Stealth]"},
[82]={"Open the Worn Wooden Chest. Loot it for the [Ensorcelled Parchment]","Use the [Ensorcelled Parchment] to start the quest"},
[83]={"Kill Nagaz. Loot him for his Head"},
[84]={"Open the Worn Wooden Chest. Loot it for the [Ensorcelled Parchment]","Use the [Ensorcelled Parchment] to start the quest"},
[85]={"Kill Argus Shadow Mages one can be found in each of the small Syndicate camps as you head south-east as well as in Strahnbrad","They do not social aggro with the Syndicate mobs, meaning you can pull them out of the camps without having to fight all of the mobs"},
[86]={"Kill Baron Vardus. Loot him for his Head","Baron Vardus can be in the outside camps, as well as the basement Inn of Strahnbrad","Be careful as he casts [Frostbolt], [Frost Nova] and [Backhand] (an instant cast two second stun)"},
[87]={"Kill Argus Shadow Mages one can be found in each of the small Syndicate camps as you head south-east as well as in Strahnbrad","They do not social aggro with the Syndicate mobs, meaning you can pull them out of the camps without having to fight all of the mobs"},
[88]={"Kill the Syndicate. Loot them for their Signet Rings","Syndicate Assassins and Syndicate Spies will be in [Stealth]"},
[89]={"Kill Crushridge Ogres and Crushridge Brutes. Loot them for their Tomes and Knucklebones"},
[90]={"Kill Crushridge Ogres and Crushridge Brutes. Loot them for their Knucklebones"},
[92]={"Be careful not to run into Tarren Mill Deathguards as you travel"},
[98]={"Buy food/water if needed","Buy food if needed"},
[110]={"Kill the Forsaken Courier. Loot her for her Sealed Folder","The Forsaken Courier patrols the road between Tarren Mill and Go'Shek Farm","If you haven't found her by the time you reached Go'Shek, grind the Orcs there for 5 minutes, then skip the step if she hasn't spawned in Jorell's house by then","Cast [Eagle Eye] to try and find the Forsaken Courier"},
[111]={"Open the Stone of West Binding. Loot it for the Burning Key","Make sure the Forsaken Courier doesn't sneak past you as you do this!"},
[114]={"Click the Messenger Bag hanging on the wall"},
[115]={"Click the Hastily Rolled-Up Satchel on the ground"},
[116]={"Kill the Forsaken Courier. Loot her for her Sealed Folder","The Forsaken Courier patrols the road between Tarren Mill and Go'Shek Farm","If you haven't found her by the time you reached Go'Shek, grind the Orcs there for 5 minutes, then skip the step if she hasn't spawned in Jorell's house by then","Cast [Eagle Eye] to try and find the Forsaken Courier"},
[119]={"Kill the Forsaken Courier. Loot her for her Sealed Folder","The Forsaken Courier patrols the road between Tarren Mill and Go'Shek Farm","Cast [Eagle Eye] to try and find the Forsaken Courier"},
[121]={"Someone may be doing the Kinelory escort if she isn't there. Wait until she returns"},
[122]={"Escort Kinelory through Go'Shek Farm"},
[126]={"Kill Kor'gresh Coldrage. Loot him for Trelane's Wand","He will cast [Trelane's Freezing Touch] which has a 3 second cast time that silences you for 12 seconds and slows your attack speed by 25%"},
[128]={"Click the Wanted Board"},
[129]={"Click the Wanted Board"},
[132]={"Click the Messenger Bag hanging on the wall"},
[133]={"Click the Hastily Rolled-Up Satchel on the ground"},
[135]={"Open the Stone of West Binding. Loot it for the Burning Key"},
[138]={"Click Bath'rah's Cauldron"},
[141]={"Accepting this quest will summon Cyclonian. He hits fairly hard, but can be soloed. Be sure to check the video for pointers on how to do so"},
[142]={"Follow Bath'rah the Windwatcher to where he will summon Cyclonian","Kill Cyclonian. Loot him for his Whirlwind Heart","Cyclonian hits fairly hard, but can be soloed. Be sure to check the video for pointers on how to do so"},
[144]={"The [Whirlwind Axe] is the best reward out of them all. However, if you do wish to choose a different weapon, it's only a small loss"},
[146]={"Click the Stone of Inner Binding"},
[147]={"Kill Fozruk. Loot him for the Rod of Order","Pull only Fozruk and run away until the adds have reset if needed to fight him alone","Try to splitpull him. This will allow you to avoid fighting the kobolds he patrols with","If you can't splitpull, focus on killing and interrupting the casts of Sleeby, Znort and Feeboz before killing Fozruk","Fozruk can be CC'd. Be careful as he periodically casts [Ground Tremor] stunning all targets within 20 yards of him for 2 seconds","His patrol path is marked on your map","Cast [Eagle Eye] to try and find Fozruk","After you deleash the kobolds and have only Fozruk on you kill him by keeping him [Feared]"},
[148]={"Click on the Keystone","If you are still in a group, hand in this quest while with your party! Thenan, a level 42 Elite will spawn. You can either kill him or run away and reset him if you're solo"},
[149]={"Click on the Keystone"},
[150]={"Kill Marez Cowl. Loot her for her Head","Marez Cowl has 2 different spawn locations. One is on the high ground location, and the other is below behind the house. They are marked on your map","Cast [Eagle Eye] to try and find which location she is in"},
[151]={"Kill Otto and Lord Falconcrest. Loot them for their Heads"},
[152]={"Kill Marez Cowl. Loot her for her Head","Marez Cowl has 2 different spawn locations. One is on the high ground location, and the other is below behind the house. They are marked on your map","Be careful as there are [Stealthed] level 36-37 elite Syndicate Prowlers in the area surrounding both her spawns","Cast [Eagle Eye] to try and find which location she is in","Skip this step if you're not confident in your ability to solo it"},
[153]={"Kill Marez Cowl. Loot her for her Head","Marez Cowl has 2 different spawn locations. One is on the high ground location, and the other is below behind the house. They are marked on your map","Be careful as there are [Stealthed] level 36-37 elite Syndicate Prowlers in the area surrounding both her spawns","Cast [Eagle Eye] to try and find which location she is in"},
[154]={"Kill Boulderfist Shamans. Loot them for the Azure Agate. try to avoid fighting Boulderfist Maulers as much as possible","Skip this step if you're not confident in your ability to solo it"},
[160]={"This will start an escort. If Professor Phizzlethorpe is not there, someone may already be doing it. Wait for him to return"},
[161]={"Escort Professor Phizzlethorpe into the small Cave","Kill the Vengeful Surges that attack once inside. Be careful as they cast [Frost Nova]","Try to tag both of the Surges before they hit the Professor. This will make them not interrupt his roleplay and make the quest complete a lot faster","Follow Professor Phizzlethorpe back to the camp afterwards"},
[167]={"Loot the Elven Gems on the sea floor","Equip your [Goggles of Gem Hunting] so the Elven Gems show up on your minimap","Cast [Aquatic Form] once your Breath Bar gets low"},
[168]={"Kill Daggerspine Raiders and Daggerspine Sorceresses","Be aware the Daggerspine Raiders will cast [Net] on you","Be mindful of your pet while doing this quest. It's pathing can get very buggy while fighting on the sunken ships"},
[169]={"Loot Maiden's Folly Log on the 2nd floor of the ship. It is inside of the Cauldron"},
[170]={"Loot Maiden's Folly Charts on the 2nd floor of the ship. It is on the Pillar"},
[172]={"Loot the Spirit of Silverpine Charts on the 2nd floor of the ship. It is on top of the Crate next to the Cannon"},
[173]={"Loot the Spirit of Silverpine Log on the bottom of the ship. It is on the sea floor"},
[174]={"Loot the Elven Gems on the sea floor","Equip your [Goggles of Gem Hunting] so the Elven Gems show up on your minimap","Cast [Aquatic Form] once your Breath Bar gets low"},
[175]={"Kill Daggerspine Raiders and Daggerspine Sorceresses","Be aware the Daggerspine Raiders will cast [Net] on you"},
[176]={"Loot the Elven Gems on the sea floor","Equip your [Goggles of Gem Hunting] so the Elven Gems show up on your minimap","Cast [Aquatic Form] once your Breath Bar gets low"},
[192]={"Teleport to Moonglade"},
[193]={"Buy food/water if needed","Buy food if needed"},
