{name="40-40 Dustwallow Marsh",lo=40,hi=40,next="40-41 Desolace",tips={
[2]={"Level your [First Aid] while waiting"},
[13]={"Buy 3 [Soothing Spices] from her"},
[15]={"Channel the [Triage Bandage] on the Alliance Soldiers. Prioritize Critically Injured Soldiers first"},
[22]={"Kill Mudrock Spikeshells and Mudrock Tortoises. Loot them for their Tongues"},
[23]={"Kill the Mirefins. Loot them for their Heads","Be careful not to swim into a Coral Shark that patrols the waters in the area. It can [Thrash] you for upwards of 1200 damage instantly"},
[24]={"Kill Mudrock Spikeshells and Mudrock Tortoises. Loot them for their Tongues"},
[25]={"Talk to \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl"},
[26]={"Talk to \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl"},
[27]={"Kill Darkmist Spiders, Darkmist Silkspinners, Darkmist Lurkers and Darkmist Recluses. Loot them for their Eyes","Be careful as all the Spiders [Poison] and there are [Stealthed] Darkmist Lurkers inside the mine"},
[28]={"Talk to \"Stinky\" Ignatz","This will start an escort quest"},
[29]={"Follow \"Stinky\" Ignatz through the Marshlands"},
[30]={"Talk to \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl"},
[31]={"Talk to \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl"},
[33]={"IF YOU CHOOSE TO ACCEPT THE FOLLOW UP QUEST YOU WILL BE PVP FLAGGED! MEANING HORDE PLAYERS CAN KILL YOU! PROCEED AT YOUR OWN RISK!","You will NOT be PvP Flagged for turning in this current quest. Auto accept has been turned OFF for the follow up. Skip the follow up if you wish to not complete it"},
[35]={"Blizzard has adjusted this quest so it will no longer PvP Flag you on Official Hardcore Servers"},
[36]={"Defeat Private Hendel. He will attack you along with 2 Theramore Sentries","They will both reset once you subdue Private Hendel"},
[45]={"Kill Corrosive Swamp Oozes. Loot them for Jameson's Training Sword"},
[46]={"Open the Gizmorium Shipping Crate. Loot it for the Seaforium Booster"},
