{name="43-44 Tanaris",lo=43,hi=44,next="44-48 Feralas",tips={
[2]={"Privateer Groy patrols through Theramore Isle"},
[6]={"Channel the [Triage Bandage] on the Alliance Soldiers. Prioritize Critically Injured Soldiers first"},
[12]={"Open the Gizmorium Shipping Crate. Loot it for the Seaforium Booster"},
[13]={"Click the Musty Scroll on the rock"},
[15]={"Teleport to Moonglade"},
[19]={"Buy food/water if needed","Buy food if needed"},
[27]={"Cast [Tame Beast] on a Starving Blisterpaw to tame it"},
[31]={"This is a timed quest. If it has timed out already, abandon it instead"},
[35]={"Click Rizzle's Unguarded Plans on the ground"},
[43]={"Kill Rocs. Loot them for their Gizzards","Don't go out of your way to finish this"},
[44]={"Kill Wastewander Bandits and Wastewander Thieves. Loot them for their Wastewander Water Pouches","Kill them en-route to your other objectives. Don't complete this immediately"},
