{name="54-55 Felwood/Winterspring",lo=54,hi=55,next="55-56 Winterspring",tips={
[4]={"You may need to wait for the RP"},
[5]={"Turn in your 6 [Corrupted Soul Shards] you have to receive 2 [Cenarion Plant Salves]","If you don't have 6 get them from the Furbolgs to the west"},
[6]={"Their locations have been marked on your map. Skip this step if you aren't able to find one"},
[8]={"Click the four Braziers on the ground"},
[9]={"Kill Jaedenar Enforcers, Jaedenar Darkweavers, Jaedenar Warlocks and Jaedenar Legionnaires. Loot them for a [Blood Red Key]","Use the [Blood Red Key] to start the quest","This will begin an escort quest. Start this escort even if you still need to Extinguish Braziers"},
[11]={"Click the four Braziers on the ground"},
[12]={"Escort Arko'narin through Shadow Hold. Once you approach the final Brazier, 3 Felguards will spawn which you will have to deal with","After exiting Shadow Hold, you will need to kill the Spirit of Trey Lightforge. Let Arko'narin tank him as much as possible"},
[13]={"Click the four Braziers on the ground"},
[15]={"Use the [Flute of the Ancients] once you are at the graveyard to summon Arei"},
[16]={"Escort Arei to the road north. He will be attacked a few times along the way"},
[18]={"Kill Deadwood Den Watchers, Deadwood Avengers and Deadwood Shamans","If you find the [Deadwood Ritual Totem], don't start the quest from this item yet"},
[20]={"If you have more than 5 [Deadwood Headdress Feathers] you may turn them in for reputation with Timbermaw Hold"},
[22]={"Kernda patrols the lower Timbermaw Hold path","Use the [Deadwood Ritual Totem] to start the quest","Skip this step if you aren't neutral with Timbermaw Hold"},
[23]={"Skip this step if you aren't friendly with Timbermaw Hold"},
[28]={"Blizzard has adjusted the quest chain for [The Videre Elixir] so it will no longer kill you on Official Hardcore Servers"},
[33]={"Kill Winterfall Pathfinders, Winterfall Den Watchers and Winterfall Totemics"},
[34]={"Kill Winterfall Furbolgs. Loot them for a [Empty Firewater Flask]","Use the [Empty Firewater Flask] to start the quest"},
[35]={"Be ready to move away from Donova Snowden quickly as after you turn in Winterfall Runners, 3 Winterfall Ambushers will attack her location"},
[37]={"Click the Deadwood Cauldron in the northern Furbolg camp","If you create an escape path, you can simply click the Deadwood Cauldron and then run away. You don't need to kill all surrounding Furbolgs"},
[40]={"Loot Moontouched Feathers on the ground"},
[44]={"Buy food/water if needed","Buy food if needed"},
[48]={"Blizzard has adjusted this quest so consuming this will NOT kill your character on Official Hardcore Servers. It will lower your health to 3% however. Ensure you bandage or eat food before leaving the graveyard"},
[49]={"Ensure you bandage or eat food before leaving the graveyard","You must have the [Near Death Experience] debuff to see Gaeriyan by drinking the [Videre Elixir]","Blizzard has adjusted this quest so consuming this will NOT kill your character on Official Hardcore Servers"},
[50]={"You must have the [Near Death Experience] debuff to see Gaeriyan by drinking the [Videre Elixir]","Blizzard has adjusted this quest so consuming this will NOT kill your character on Official Hardcore Servers"},
[51]={"You must be dead in order to speak to Gaeriyan"},
[52]={"Click the Conspicuous Gravestone"},
[53]={"Click the Conspicuous Gravestone"},
[57]={"Talk to J.D. Collie"},
[60]={"Talk to J.D. Collie"},
[70]={"Kill Bears and Wolves in Felwood. Loot them for their Silvery Claws"},
[71]={"Kill Bears and Wolves in Felwood. Loot them for their Silvery Claws"},
[73]={"Kill Rakaiah"},
[75]={"Continue further into Shadow Hold","Kill Salia, Moora and Shadow Lord Fel'dan. Loot him for his Head","Kill Salia first as she casts [Mind Control]"},
[76]={"Kill Bears and Wolves in Felwood. Loot them for their Silvery Claws"},
[77]={"Kill Bears and Wolves in Felwood. Loot them for their Silvery Claws"},
